This update completes the storyline, giving an epic conclusion the long and bombastic (mis)adventures of the four nerds! :PizzaAdv:

We wanted to celebrate this long adventure with a CRAZY SALE! Starting at 10.00am US Pacific.
Doom & Destiny Advanced will NOT on sale on Steam no (but it will be very soon!!!), but it will be on sale on every other mobile platform, as well as all our other games! :fsm: :happyminer: :mypizza: :minersoul:

